  "comments": "<p>Manuel Deodoro da Fonseca (1827-1892) established the First Brazilian Republic in 1889, and served as the first president of Brazil.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"T\" partially and wholly inside the stripes<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5a94457fafaf2.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5a94457fafaf2.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce208cba635.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce208cba635.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce20913bc7d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce20913bc7d.jpg\"></a></p><p>Official Sets - 2018 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2019 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"></a></p><p>Official card with complete set, including 1 real commemorative coin</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce20aab57be.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce20aab57be.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce20af2bf6a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce20af2bf6a.jpg\"></a></p><p>Official Sets - 2020 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogu